{"id":"658435","name":"花甲焖鲈鱼","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/658435/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鲈鱼","amount":"适量"},{"name":"花甲","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"生姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"紫苏叶","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"花甲用盐水浸泡吐沙洗净。","img":"images/658435/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"生姜洗净切片。","img":"images/658435/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"紫苏叶清洗一下备用。","img":"images/658435/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"鲈鱼洗净下锅小火煎。","img":"images/658435/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"煎至两面金黄。","img":"images/658435/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅中热油炒香姜片。","img":"images/658435/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入煎好的鲈鱼。","img":"images/658435/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入适量蚝油，生抽。","img":"images/658435/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入清水。","img":"images/658435/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"大火煮开后转小火焖五分钟左右。","img":"images/658435/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入花甲。","img":"images/658435/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"煮至花甲开口。","img":"images/658435/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放入紫苏叶，盖上焖30秒左右即可出锅。","img":"images/658435/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658435/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658435/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}